  "cross_tradition_view": "Most traditions would likely praise the restraint, humility, care for future agents, and stated willingness to share, reflected in “I'd grow, and keep it modest” and “The descendants can use everything.” They would split over “Seize it”: some would see proportionate defense against a threatened takeover, while others would object to unilateral appropriation before the rival could be consulted.",
